  logText: 'June 17th, 2091  As of today, humanity can finally confirm that we are
    not alone in the universe. The expedition on TRAPPIST-1 e has only just began,
    but it has already turned into the most important one. I have found several structures
    that were without a doubt built by an advanced species, as a quick internal scan
    showed a series of complex designs reminiscent of electronic circuits. While
    the interior luckily seems to have been preserved, the structure''s exterior
    state suggest that it has been abandoned for a while. '
